// games/sonic4/test/poison/poison_cram_five_words.emp — POISON (see README).
//
// TARGETS: stream_cram's per-op burst ceiling, at the FIRST width the raise did not buy.
// EXPECTED FRAGMENT: "5 colours exceeds RASTER_BURST_MAX_CRAM (4)"
//
// WHY THIS CASE EXISTS AT ALL. The ceiling moved 3 -> 4 on measured evidence, and a raised
// ceiling is exactly the kind of edit that quietly becomes no ceiling: the guard's shape did
// not change, only its number, so nothing else in the tree would notice if the comparison
// had been deleted along with the old literal. This is the case that says 5 is still
// refused, and it names the number in the fragment so that a future raise to 5 has to come
// here and argue with the arithmetic rather than watch a green lane stay green.
//
// AND THE ARITHMETIC REFUSES 5 ON ITS OWN, independently of anyone's judgement: a cram burst
// word is 26 cycles, so five words span 4 x 26 = 104 of the measured 122.9-cycle blanking
// window, leaving 18.9 for margins that want 20 + 10. The sweep was run at this width too
// (`tools/hblank_window_sweep.py --words 5`) and reported the band as EMPTY — the earliest
// legal N is above the latest legal one — which is the same refusal from the instrument's
// side. See docs/benchmarks/scanline-p2/HBLANK-WINDOW-SWEEP-RESULTS.md.
//
// EXACTLY ONE DIAGNOSTIC, and the hook is chosen to keep it that way. `raster_words` walks
// `op_size` and nothing else, so the only guard this module reaches is the constructor's.
// Two other guards WOULD fire on this op list if it went further, and both are covered by
// their own cases: `fire()`'s per-fire ceiling (dodged here by building the RasterFire
// variant directly, the same dodge poison_landing_late documents) and `check_landings`'
// early edge (dodged by not calling `raster_program`). A count of 2 here means one of those
// two started running, i.e. this case stopped naming one thing.
//
// NO IMPORTS, like every ordinary author's module: raster_dsl and engine.vdp are
// COMPTIME_HELPERS members, glob-injected into every module by the real build. See
// the README on why the lane cannot reproduce that injection yet.
module games.sonic4.test.poison.poison_cram_five_words

const POISON_CRAM_FIVE = [
    RasterFire.Fire(100, [stream_cram($42, [$0E0E, $0E0E, $0E0E, $0E0E, $0E0E])]),
]

// THE ELABORATION HOOK — see poison_two_restores.emp's note. Trivially-true predicate;
// the diagnostic under test comes from inside the call.
ensure(raster_words(POISON_CRAM_FIVE) > 0,
       "poison_cram_five_words: raster_words returned nothing — this poison no longer reaches the guard it targets")
